   "description": "The Munro captures the essence of a true field watch - a classic redefined. \"Whole heartedly, watch of the year!\" - Will Duncan, Zaltek Reviews SPECS AT A GLANCE • Provenance - designed and assembled by hand in Britain • Dimensions - 37.5mm diameter, 45mm lug length, 20mm lug width • Thinness - 9.25mm case, 10mm total (including top hat crystal) • Water resistance - 150m • Movement - high beat automatic Miyota 9039, regulated in 3 positions to a minimum accuracy of +/- 12s/d • Crystal - antiglare box sapphire crystal with 8 internal layers of AR coating • Lume - hands and applied markers deep-filled with 10 layers of Grade A BGW9 EXTRAS • Premium double-stitched leather pouch • One UK native tree planted per watch • At least 2x the carbon footprint of each watch is off-set • 2 Year Warranty",
