   "description": "The Photic MKII Swiss Edition is sold out. However, it may not be our last venture into Swiss watchmaking. Interested in what comes next? We'd love to know, register your interest here.(/photic-mkii-swiss-edition) To celebrate five years of Clemence, we've created the Photic MKII Swiss Edition. Our first Swiss-powered watch, and a milestone we've been working towards for some time. At its heart is the Swiss-made Soprod M100, chosen for its exceptional engineering, slender profile and precision. Each movement is carefully calibrated across five positions to ±4 seconds per day. A distinctive Atoll Blue dial with blasted matt finish, and a colour-matched sapphire bezel, featuring our first countdown scale, set this edition apart, while retaining everything that makes the Photic MKII special: a slender 9.9mm case, 200m water resistance and meticulous British hand assembly. Limited to just 25 pieces worldwide, this is a celebration of how far we've come, and a glimpse of where we're heading. Read the full details here.(https://www.clemencewatches.com/photic-mkii-swiss-edition)",
